  (text "WARNING: SHARED GPIO PINS\n\nGPIO7 is shared between:\n  - J8 (Soil Moisture Shallow) — Agriculture\n  - J12 (Pyranometer ML8511) — Solar\n\nGPIO16 (1-Wire Bus A) is shared between:\n  - J10 (Soil Temperature DS18B20) — Agriculture\n  - J13 (Panel Temp Front DS18B20) — Solar\n\nONLY enable one industry feature at compile time,\nor physically rewire to separate GPIOs.\n\nCargo.toml:\n  [features]\n  agriculture = []    # Uses GPIO 7, 16, 17, 18\n  solar = []          # Uses GPIO 7, 16, 19, 20\n  all-industries = [\"agriculture\", \"solar\"]  # CONFLICT!"
    (at 130.81 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (bold yes) (color 255 0 0 1)) (justify left))
  )

  (text "CONNECTOR PINOUTS:\n\nJ8/J9/J11 (3-pin JST-PH):\n  Pin 1 = VCC (3.3V)\n  Pin 2 = GND\n  Pin 3 = SIGNAL (ADC)\n\nJ10/J13/J14 (3-pin JST-PH):\n  Pin 1 = VCC (3.3V)\n  Pin 2 = GND\n  Pin 3 = DATA (1-Wire)\n\nJ12 (4-pin JST-PH):\n  Pin 1 = VCC (3.3V)\n  Pin 2 = GND\n  Pin 3 = OUT (analog)\n  Pin 4 = EN (tie to VCC)\n\nJ15 (2-pin JST-PH):\n  Pin 1 = SIGNAL (pulse)\n  Pin 2 = GND"
    (at 130.81 100.33 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left))
  )

  (text "SENSOR SPECIFICATIONS:\n\nAGRICULTURE:\n  Soil Moisture: Capacitive v1.2/v2.0, 3.3V, 0-3V analog out\n  Soil Temp: DS18B20 waterproof probe, -55 to +125C, ±0.5C\n  Leaf Wetness: Resistive grid, 3.3V, higher voltage = wetter\n\nSOLAR:\n  Pyranometer: ML8511 UV sensor breakout, 0-15mW/cm² → 0-3V\n  Panel Temp: DS18B20 epoxy-mount probes (front and back)\n  Power Meter: S0 pulse interface (1000 imp/kWh typical)\n  \nCABLING:\n  All cables through IP68 cable glands (PG7/PG9)\n  DS18B20 1-Wire: max 5m cable (CAT5 recommended)\n  ADC signals: max 2m shielded cable"
    (at 280.67 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left))
  )

)
